<title>POLAND: PEKPOL SEES 1997 NET PROFIT UP 39 PCT.</title>
<headline>PEKPOL SEES 1997 NET PROFIT UP 39 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish meat processor Pekpol SA expects to lift net profit this year by 39.1 percent to 2.53 million zlotys and sales by 25.1 percent to 247.7 million zlotys, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
